        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How is the cost of packers and movers Bangalore to Noida calculated?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The cost is derived from a combination of distance‑based mileage, total volume or weight of goods, type of packing material selected, and any special handling requirements such as fragile or oversized items. Shree Ashirwad applies a transparent fixed‑price matrix that includes fuel surcharge, toll fees, and a mandatory insurance premium, ensuring no hidden charges appear after the move.</p>
