      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is my furniture fully insured during the intercity move from Bangalore to Noida?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">All shipments are covered by an IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance policy that offers 100 % declared‑value coverage. The policy protects against loss, theft, and accidental damage, and a claim can be processed within 48 hours of delivery. The insurance premium is included in the fixed‑price quote, so there are no extra fees.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What makes the 7‑layer packaging system superior for long‑distance moves?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The 7‑layer system combines high‑density bubble wrap, multi‑ply corrugated sheets, reinforced edge protectors, moisture‑resistant stretch film, custom wooden crates, and a final outer layer of weather‑proof sheeting. Each layer is engineered to absorb shocks, prevent vibration, and guard against humidity, ensuring that delicate items such as glassware, electronics, and temple idols arrive intact after the Bangalore to Noida trek.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How long does a typical Bangalore to Noida relocation take?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Under normal traffic conditions, the dedicated container truck completes the 2,250‑km journey in 38‑44 hours, including scheduled rest stops and mandatory checkpost inspections. Shree Ashirwad’s route performance data shows an on‑time delivery rate of 96 %, and any unforeseen delays are communicated instantly via the tracking portal.</p>
